    "body": "\r\nThe menubar element & the menulist element is \"Interactive content\"?\r\n\r\n\r\nThe menubar element & the menulist element should be added to section of \"3.2.5.2.2 Flow content\" <del> &\"3.2.5.2.8 Palpable content\"</del> .\r\n\r\n<del>\r\nIn section of \"4.4.19 The div element\";\r\n- The \"menuitem element inner content elements\" should be added to \"Categories:\".\r\n- The \"Otherwise, if the element is a descendant of an menuitem element: Zero or more menuitem element inner content elements.\" should be added to \"Content model:\".\r\n\r\n\r\nIn section of \"4.10.15 The fieldset element\";\r\n- The \"menulist element inner content elements\" should be added to \"Categories:\".\r\n- \"Content model:\" of \"if the element is a descendant of a menulist element\" should be clarified.\r\n\r\n\r\nIn section of \"4.4.2 The hr element\";\r\n- The \"menulist element inner content elements\" should be added to \"Categories:\".\r\n</del>\r\n\r\nThe section of \"15.3.12 The fieldset and legend elements\" also apply to fieldset & legend elements who is descendant of a menulist or menubar element?\r\n",
