    "body": "> The following are menubar element inner content elements:\r\n> →   div, fieldset, menuitem, span\r\n\r\n> The following are menulist element inner content elements:\r\n> →   div, fieldset, hr, menuitem, span\r\n\r\n\r\nIs the `<span>` element necessary?\r\nIsn't the `<div>` element enough?\r\nWhat use cases are envisioned for using the `<span>` element as a descendant element of the `<menulist>` or `<menubar>` element?\r\n",
