    "body": "```\r\n<menubar>\r\n  <submenu>\r\n   <menuitem command=\"show-modal\" commandfor=\"dialog1\">menuitem1</menuitem>\r\n   <menulist>\r\n    ...\r\n   </menulist>\r\n  </submenu>\r\n</menubar>\r\n\r\n<dialog id=\"dialog1\">\r\n    ...\r\n</dialog>\r\n```\r\n\r\nIn this case, how does \"menuitem1\" behave?\r\n\r\nIt might be best to prohibit specifying the `command` and `commandfor` attribute on `menuitem` element that are child of a `submenu` element.\r\n\r\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
